" Personal Superlemon overrides
"
" This is a normal Vim configuration fragment. Superlemon's managed startup
" reads its bundled defaults first and sources this file exactly once after
" them, so values here win. The bundled defaults continue to evolve without
" being copied into this user-owned file.
"
" Examples (remove the leading quote to enable one):
" let g:superlemon_native_tabs = 0
" let g:superlemon_native_statusbar = 0
" let g:superlemon_native_minimap = 0
" let g:superlemon_native_scrollbars = 1
" set guifont=SF\ Mono:h13
" set linespace=2
"
" Ordinary mappings, autocmds, options, and plugin configuration are welcome.
